l if you have ever been wondering what  Ritchie's personal fear was you might be  surprised to learn that it was actually  revealed not only in the movie but also  in the trailer don't you think that  penny wisest hand is a little hairy  that's because Ritchie is afraid of  werewolves and it takes his form the  balloon the red balloon is something  that we immediately recognize when  Pennywise is near by something so  innocent shouldn't be so threatening  unless you know what is coming next  whether it is in a classroom next to an  abandoned house or in a car we have  never been so terrified of something so  childish and so simple however this  balloon is  complicated than what you might think  when Patrick was lured by penny once and  saw the red balloon you could read the  phrase I heart Derry if you didn't  understand it you are not the only one  and know the scary clown didn't mean  that he liked to live in this town it is  actually a reference to the novel in the  second chapter of the book a gay man  named Adrian melon passed away when he  was the victim of a homophobic hate  crime at the dairy carnival there was a  Hart dairy merchandise everywhere and he  was wearing an I heart Derry hat when he  took his last breath you won't be happy  to hear that it was even inspired by a  real crime  but anyway Patrick himself is a closeted  homosexual in the novel and this could  be a way to show that these similar  characters won't be alive for a long  time so beware next time you see a red  balloon coming out of nowhere  Pennywise might be watching you the last  losers after being terrified for two  hours we couldn't believe that it was  already the end of the movie this time  the losers were standing in a circle  holding hands and they swore that they  would come back to Derry as adults if  Pennywise came back and if you closely  paid attention to who left the circle  first you might already know what is  going to happen in the sequel the first  one to leave is stamp and if you read  the book you know that he is the first  one who ends his life then there's Eddie  who will pass away in the final battle  with the creature at least bill and  Beverley will be happy to hear about  that because they were the last two to  leave the circle but we will have to  watch the sequel to know if this theory  was right if you read the novel you know  that the first line of the story hints  that Pennywise might still be alive  but plenty wise swore that he would  never write about him again because the  character is too scary even for him so  that means that all we could have left  is another movie are you a fan you  noticed another small detail in the  movie don't be shy to tell us what it is  in the comments section down below we  love to hear what you think and that's  it for small details in it that only  true fans notice for more stories like  this make sure you watch 10 cartoon  secrets finally revealed thanks for  watching and see you next time  [Music]

